                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "1. About These Terms"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "These Terms and Conditions apply to the website coppereagleplumbing.com and to the text message (SMS) program operated by Copper Eagle Plumbing LLC (\"Copper Eagle Plumbing,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\"), a plumbing services company based in Salt Lake City, Utah. By using our website or opting in to receive text messages from us, you agree to these Terms."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "2. SMS Messaging Program"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Program name: Copper Eagle Plumbing Customer Text Messages. Copper Eagle Plumbing LLC sends the following types of text messages:"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "unordered-list",
                            "items": [
                                [
                                    {
                                        "text": "Customer care and service messages:",
                                        "mark": "strong"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "text": " appointment confirmations, scheduling updates, technician arrival notices, estimates, invoices, job photos, and service follow-ups."
                                    }
                                ],
                                [
                                    {
                                        "text": "Marketing messages (only if you separately opt in):",
                                        "mark": "strong"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "text": " special offers, discounts, and seasonal maintenance reminders."
                                    }
                                ]
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "3. How You Opt In"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "You can opt in by checking the text message consent box(es) on our contact form at "
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "coppereagleplumbing.com/contact-copper-eagle-plumbing",
                                    "href": "/contact-copper-eagle-plumbing/"
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": ". Service messages and marketing messages have separate checkboxes, and both are unchecked by default. Checking either box is optional. Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchase, and you can still contact us and request service without opting in."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "4. Message Frequency"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Message frequency varies based on your service requests and communication needs."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "5. Message and Data Rates"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Message and data rates may apply. Check with your mobile carrier for details about your plan."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "6. How to Opt Out"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "You can cancel text messages at any time by replying "
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "STOP",
                                    "mark": "strong"
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": " to any message. You will receive one final message confirming that you have been unsubscribed, and you will not receive further messages unless you opt in again. To resubscribe, reply "
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "START",
                                    "mark": "strong"
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "7. Help"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "For help, reply "
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "HELP",
                                    "mark": "strong"
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": " to any message, call or text us at (385) 625-0369, or email diamond9utah@gmail.com."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "8. Carrier Disclaimer"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery is subject to effective transmission by your mobile carrier."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "9. Eligibility"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "By opting in, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old and that you are the account holder of the mobile number provided or have the account holder's permission to enroll it."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "10. Privacy"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Your information is handled according to our Privacy Policy at "
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "coppereagleplumbing.com/privacy-policy",
                                    "href": "/privacy-policy/"
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": ". We do not sell or share your mobile number, SMS opt-in data, or consent with third parties or affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "11. Use of Our Website"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Content on this website is provided for general information about our plumbing services. Estimates, pricing, and availability are confirmed directly with our team and may change based on the specific job. You agree not to misuse the website or interfere with its operation."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "heading",
                            "level": 3,
                            "text": "12. Changes to These Terms"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "paragraph",
                            "segments": [
                                {
                                    "text": "We may update these Terms from time to time. When we do, we will update the Effective Date above and post the new version on this page."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
